3GPP TS 29.561 V19.6.0 defines these AVPs in vendor 10415, which the
dictionary has no entry for at their codes:

  3GPP-Notification (110): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-UE-MAC-Address (111): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Authorization-Reference (112): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Policy-Reference (113): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Session-AMBR (114): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-NAI (115): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Session-AMBR-v2 (116): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-IP-Address-Pool-Info (118): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-VLAN-Id (119): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-TNAP-Identifier (120): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-HFC-NodeId (121): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-GLI (122): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Line-Type (123): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-NID (124): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Session-S-NSSAI (125): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-CHF-FQDN (126): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Serving-NF-FQDN (127): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Session-Id (128): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-GCI (129): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-DNAI (130): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-RSN (131): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Session-Pair-Id (132): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-Charging-Id-v2 (133): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-VLAN-Handling (134): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-MSK (135): OctetString, clause 11.3.1
  3GPP-S-NSSAI (200): UTF8String, clause 16.3.1

Each entry's type, enumerated values and grouped members are the
document's, from its clauses and AVP tables, and so are its M and V bits
where the document states them.

